p0f.fp is vendored verbatim (byte-for-byte, `diff`-clean) from the p0f
project and is not modified by this repository. Do not hand-edit it — if a
signature needs to change, that is a p0f upstream change, not one here.

Upstream:  p0f 3.09b (Debian package `p0f`, file /etc/p0f/p0f.fp)
Source:    http://lcamtuf.coredump.cx/p0f3/releases/
